        <item>
            <title>0.2.0</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 16:51:00 -0500</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>0.2.0</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.2.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Stash 0.2.0</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Keyboard everything.</strong> Arrows move, ⌘← ⌘→ switch teams, Return opens, ⌘C copies the link. Press ? for the full list.</li>
  <li><strong>Dark thumbnails in dark mode.</strong> Spaces with a dark theme now show it in the grid.</li>
  <li><strong>Tabs fade at the edges</strong> when there are more teams than fit.</li>
  <li><strong>Updates.</strong> The app checks for new versions on its own, or use Check for Updates… in the settings menu.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
